{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n去日本旅遊，藥妝店也是必去行程之一！近日有日本網民在 Threads 發文大推一款老牌「止咳神器」——淺田飴，分享一個車程的時間就能止咳。亮橙色包裝的淺田飴，主打添加氣管支擴張成分（如甲基麻黃鹼等），能放鬆氣管平滑肌，有效舒緩劇烈咳嗽與化痰；另有紫色包裝則主打改善喉嚨發炎疼痛。不過藥劑專業人員提醒大家：這款產品實為「指定醫藥品」，不能當零食喉糖狂食！必須嚴格依據年齡指引、每日指定次數與劑量服用。\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179441282244750049_2483383066af49116c9856.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179441282244750049_2483383066af49116c9856.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944128242961673_11688208476af49118b45af.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944128242961673_11688208476af49118b45af.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179441282626567510_3783350566af4911aa87ac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179441282626567510_3783350566af4911aa87ac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179441282790440247_17578572726af4911c3fbba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179441282790440247_17578572726af4911c3fbba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfmpVAtDxdz/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:21:17.597823+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T16:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T19:16:57.358528+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:40.083281+00:00","content_hash":"0258300f6c0d0303f83eb9e66b1dad266247e9d55ea9c2c94812caafd145ae47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}